    "The link can be changed to be easy to remember, but do not set it to something that is easy to guess." : {
      "comment" : "Help text below the editable token of a custom public link.",
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Linket kan ændres, så det er let at huske, men vælg ikke noget, der er let at gætte."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Link kann so geändert werden, dass er leicht zu merken ist, aber wählen Sie keinen Link, der leicht zu erraten ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The link can be changed to be easy to remember, but do not set it to something that is easy to guess."
